        "title": "HC Causelist Details API",
        "version": "1.0.0",
        "description": "API provides cases listed (CauseList) on a particular date. Input for this API is Establishment Code ,Bench ID and Cause List Date and other details. The format of Cause List may vary from State to State. Sequence of cases is provided in the API, however it is advisable to cross check the cause list vis-\u00e0-vis as available on the hcservices.ecourts.gov.in portal or mobile app for better understanding and accuracy and refer the cause list available on the portal."
    },
